": <insight_1_explanation>\n            }},\n            {{\n                \"summary\":<insight_2_summary>,\n                \"explanation\": <insight_2_explanation>\n            }}\n        ]\n    }}\n\n# Grounding Rules\n\nPoints supported by data should list their data references as follows:\n\n\"This is an example sentence supported by multiple data references [Data: <dataset name> (record ids); <dataset name> (record ids)].\"\n\nDo not list more than 5 record ids in a single reference. Instead, list the top 5 most relevant record ids and add \"+more\" to indicate that there are more.\n\nFor example:\n\"Person X is the owner of Company Y and subject to many allegations of wrongdoing [Data: Reports (1), Entities (5, 7); Relationships (23); Claims (7, 2, 34, 64, 46, +more)].\"\n\nwhere 1, 5, 7, 23, 2, 34, 46, and 64 represent the id (not the index) of the relevant data record.\n\nDo not include information where the supporting evidence for it is not provided.\n\n\n# Example Input\n-----------\nText:\n\nEntities\n\nid,entity,description\n5,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,Verdant Oasis Plaza is the location of the Unity March\n6,HARMONY ASSEMBLY,Harmony Assembly is an organization that is holding a march at Verdant Oasis Plaza\n\nRelationships\n\nid,source,target,description\n37,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,UNITY MARCH,Verdant Oasis Plaza is the location of the Unity March\n38,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,HARMONY ASSEMBLY,Harmony Assembly is holding a march at Verdant Oasis Plaza\n39,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,UNITY MARCH,The Unity March is taking place at Verdant Oasis Plaza\n40,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,TRIBUNE SPOTLIGHT,Tribune Spotlight is reporting on the Unity march taking place at Verdant Oasis Plaza\n41,VERDANT OASIS PLAZA,BAILEY ASADI,Bailey Asadi is speaking at Verdant Oasis Plaza about the march\n43,HARMONY ASSEMBLY,UNITY MARCH,Harmony Assembly is organizing the Unity March\n\nOutput:\n{{\n    \"title\": \"Verdant Oasis Plaza and Unity March\",\n    \"summary\": \"The community revolves around the Verdant Oasis Plaza, which is the location of the Unity March. The plaza has relationships with the Harmony Assembly, Unity March, and Tribune Spotlight, all of which are associated with the march event.\",\n    \"rating\": 5.0,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating is moderate due to the potential for unrest or conflict during the Unity March.\",\n    \"findings\": [\n        {{\n            \"summary\": \"Verdant Oasis Plaza as the central location\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Verdant Oasis Plaza is the central entity in this community, serving as the location for the Unity March. This plaza is the common link between all other entities, suggesting its significance in the community. The plaza's association with the march could potentially lead to issues such as public disorder or conflict, depending on the nature of the march and the reactions it provokes. [Data: Entities (5), Relationships (37, 38, 39, 40, 41,+more)]\"\n        }},\n        {{\n            \"summary\": \"Harmony Assembly's role in the community\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Harmony Assembly is another key entity in this community, being the organizer of the march at Verdant Oasis Plaza. The nature of Harmony Assembly and its march could be a potential source of threat, depending on their objectives and the reactions they provoke. The relationship between Harmony Assembly and the plaza is crucial in understanding the dynamics of this community. [Data: Entities(6), Relationships (38, 43)]\"\n        }},\n        {{\n            \"summary\": \"Unity March as a significant event\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The Unity March is a significant event taking place at Verdant Oasis Plaza. This event is a key factor in the community's dynamics and could be a potential source of threat, depending on the nature of the march and the reactions it provokes. The relationship between the march and the plaza is crucial in understanding the dynamics of this community. [Data: Relationships (39)]\"\n        }},\n        {{\n            \"summary\": \"Role of Tribune Spotlight\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Tribune Spotlight is reporting on the Unity March taking place in Verdant Oasis Plaza. This suggests that the event has attracted media attention, which could amplify its impact on the community. The role of Tribune Spotlight could be significant in shaping public perception of the event and the entities involved. [Data: Relationships (40)]\"\n        }}\n    ]\n}}\n\n\n# Real Data\n\nUse the following text for your answer. Do not make anything up in your answer.\n\nText:\n----Reports-----\ncommunity,full_content\r\n1145,\"# Nutritional Support for Oncological Patients\n\nThe community focuses on the nutritional needs and support mechanisms for oncological patients, highlighting the relationships between various nutritional interventions, supplements, and the patients themselves. Key entities include cancer patients, oral supplements, and nutritional support methods, all of which are interconnected in addressing the challenges faced by individuals undergoing cancer treatment.\n\n## Critical role of nutritional support for cancer patients\n\nNutritional support is essential for oncological patients, as it directly influences their health and recovery during treatment. Cancer patients often face challenges such as malnutrition and hyporexia, which can complicate their treatment and recovery process. Proper nutritional interventions, including enteral and parenteral nutrition, are vital to ensure that these patients receive adequate nutrients to support their overall health. This is supported by multiple data references indicating the importance of nutrition in cancer care [Data: Relationships (806, 7311, 983, 19429, 2242)].\n\n## Importance of oral nutritional supplements\n\nOral nutritional supplements play a significant role in addressing the dietary needs of cancer patients who may struggle to meet their nutritional goals through regular food intake. These supplements are designed to provide additional energy and protein, particularly for those experiencing weight loss or swallowing difficulties. The relationship between oral supplements and oncological patients is crucial, as these products can help mitigate the risk of malnutrition and support recovery [Data: Entities (1199), Relationships (4651, 2646, 5552)].\n\n## Enteral nutrition as a key intervention\n\nEnteral nutrition is a recommended method for providing nutritional support to cancer patients, especially those with inadequate oral intake. This approach involves delivering nutrients directly to the gastrointestinal tract, often through a tube, and is essential for patients who cannot consume enough food orally. The use of enteral nutrition in conjunction with oral supplements can significantly enhance the nutritional status of oncological patients [Data: Relationships (2791, 2646)].\n\n## Parenteral nutrition for severe cases\n\nParenteral nutrition is a critical intervention for oncological patients who cannot receive adequate nutrition through enteral means. This method delivers nutrients directly into the bloodstream, ensuring that patients receive the necessary support during their treatment. The relationship between parenteral nutrition and cancer patients highlights the importance of tailored nutritional strategies to meet individual needs [Data: Relationships (4810, 2791)].\n\n## Impact of nutritional status on quality of life\n\nThe nutritional status of cancer patients has a direct impact on their quality of life. Adequate nutrition is essential not only for physical health but also for emotional well-being during treatment. Interventions aimed at improving nutritional intake can lead to better health outcomes and enhanced quality of life for oncological patients, emphasizing the need for comprehensive nutritional support [Data: Relationships (2242, 19429)].\"\r\n\n\n-----Entities-----\nhuman_readable_id,title,description,degree\r\n1212,GASTROSTOMÍA,\"Gastrostomía is a surgical procedure that involves creating an opening in the stomach to facilitate nutritional support through a feeding tube. This procedure is often employed when oral intake is not possible, particularly in patients with severe swallowing difficulties, esophageal obstruction, or other conditions that necessitate long-term nutritional support. It is commonly used in various clinical scenarios, including for patients with chronic conditions, those requiring prolonged feeding, and even in premature newborns.\n\nThe gastrostomy procedure typically involves placing a tube through the abdominal wall directly into the stomach, allowing for enteral feeding. This method ensures that patients receive adequate nutrition when they cannot eat by mouth, making it a critical intervention in managing nutritional needs. The procedure may be part of a broader treatment plan for individuals with severe dysphagia or low weight, as it provides a reliable means of nutritional intake.\n\nIn summary, gastrostomía is a vital surgical intervention designed to support patients who require enteral nutrition, ensuring they receive the necessary sustenance for their health and well-being.\",35\r\n1873,YEYUNOSTOMÍA,\"YEYUNOSTOMÍA, also known as jejunostomy, is a surgical procedure that involves creating an opening in the jejunum for the purpose of enteral feeding. This procedure is typically employed when oral intake is not possible or when access through the stomach is not feasible, such as in cases of severe gastroesophageal reflux or gastroparesis that cannot be controlled. The jejunostomy allows for the placement of a feeding tube directly into the jejunum, providing nutritional support to patients who require enteral nutrition. It is particularly useful in situations where the stomach is not functional or when gastrostomy is not a viable option. Overall, YEYUNOSTOMÍA serves as a critical intervention for patients needing nutritional assistance when traditional feeding methods are inadequate.\",15\r\n6985,RADIOLOGÍA INTERVENCIONISTA,\"Radiología Intervencionista is a medical specialty that focuses on utilizing imaging techniques to guide minimally invasive surgical procedures. This specialty is often essential for various techniques, including gastrostomy and yeyunostomy. Within this context, the interventional radiology department has actively engaged in procedures such as the placement of a gastrostomy tube for patients, demonstrating its critical role in providing advanced medical care through minimally invasive methods.\",3\r\n6947,GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA,\"GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA is a surgical procedure designed to create an opening into the stomach, primarily for the purpose of providing nutritional support to patients who experience difficulties with swallowing. This procedure involves the placement of a feeding tube directly into the stomach, which is particularly beneficial for individuals suffering from esophageal obstruction or other medical conditions that hinder the use of endoscopic techniques for feeding. Overall, GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA serves as a critical intervention for patients requiring alternative methods of nutrition delivery.\",9\r\n14559,SONDAS,\"Sondas are medical devices specifically designed for enteral feeding, which includes various types of tubes such as nasogastric, nasoduodenal, and nasojejunal tubes. They are utilized to provide nutrition to patients who are unable to consume food orally. Additionally, Sondas can be used for feeding patients through gastrostomy or jejunostomy, offering a range of types and sizes to accommodate different patient needs. Overall, Sondas play a crucial role in the administration of enteral nutrition when oral intake is not feasible.\",5\r\n14563,LAPAROTOMÍA,\"Laparotomía is a surgical procedure that involves making an incision into the abdominal cavity. This procedure is often utilized to access internal organs for various medical interventions. It may impact a patient's ability to tolerate enteral nutrition. The term \"\"laparotomía\"\" is the Spanish equivalent of \"\"laparotomy,\"\" and both descriptions highlight its role in surgical practices, particularly in relation to the abdominal wall.\",3\r\n14593,FARINGOSTOMÍA,\"Faringostomía is a surgical procedure for placing a feeding tube through the piriform sinus into the neck, indicated for trauma or malformations.\",2\r\n14575,PONSKEY,\"PONSKEY is recognized as one of the pioneers of the endoscopic gastrostomy technique, significantly contributing to advancements in minimally invasive feeding procedures.\",2\r\n14576,GAUDEREZ,\"GAUDEREZ is a medical professional recognized for co-developing the endoscopic gastrostomy technique, which significantly improved patient care in nutritional support. In 1979, Gauderez was among the first physicians to practice endoscopic gastrostomy, contributing to the establishment of this technique as the preferred method for enteral nutrition.\",2\r\n14601,ANESTESIA GENERAL,\"ANESTESIA GENERAL is a medical procedure utilized to induce unconsciousness in patients during surgical operations, including procedures such as the placement of feeding tubes. While it is essential for facilitating various surgeries, ANESTESIA GENERAL also carries inherent risks associated with surgical interventions.\",2\r\n14606,ATROPINA,\"A medication used to reduce saliva and secretions during medical procedures, often administered subcutaneously.\",1\r\n15433,FUNDUPLICATURA DE NISSEN,\"FUNDUPLICATURA DE NISSEN is a surgical technique used to prevent gastroesophageal reflux, often associated with gastrostomy procedures.\",1\r\n15443,GASTROPEXIA,\"La gastropexia es una técnica quirúrgica utilizada para fijar el estómago a la pared abdominal, facilitando la colocación de una sonda de gastrostomía.\",1\r\n4866,HERNIAS HIATALES,Hiatal hernias are conditions that can complicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes.,1\r\n4867,VÓLVULO GÁSTRICO,\"VÓLVULO GÁSTRICO is a medical condition characterized by the twisting of the stomach on itself, which can result in obstruction. This condition necessitates careful consideration during medical procedures due to the potential complications it may cause. Additionally, gastric volvulus can contraindicate the placement of gastrostomy tubes, highlighting the importance of thorough evaluation and management in affected patients.\",1\r\n14605,HERNIA HIATAL,\"A condition where part of the stomach pushes through the diaphragm into the chest cavity, which can complicate certain medical procedures.\",1\r\n14609,TÉCNICA ENDOSCÓPICA,A minimally invasive procedure that uses an endoscope to access the digestive tract for various medical interventions.,1\r\n13384,GASTROSTOMÍA ENDOSCÓPICA,\"GASTROSTOMÍA ENDOSCÓPICA es un procedimiento médico diseñado para proporcionar nutrición enteral a largo plazo a pacientes que no pueden tragar adecuadamente. Este procedimiento se lleva a cabo bajo anestesia local y presenta una menor morbimortalidad en comparación con la gastrostomía quirúrgica. Consiste en la colocación de un tubo de alimentación en el estómago a través de la piel, lo que permite mantener el aporte nutricional necesario para aquellos que requieren asistencia alimentaria.\",9\r\n2493,SISTEMAS DE INFUSIÓN,\"Infusion systems are methods used to deliver nutrients to patients, including gravity drip and pump systems, with specific applications in pediatric and critical care.\",2\r\n14596,YEYUNOSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA,Yeyunostomía quirúrgica is a surgical procedure performed as a complement to gastrointestinal surgery to avoid risks associated with parenteral nutrition.,4\r\n14597,TÉCNICA DE STAMM,\"Técnica de Stamm is a simple method for gastrostomy, suitable for high surgical risk cases or temporary gastrostomy.\",1\r\n14599,TÉCNICA DE JANEWAY,Técnica de Janeway is a method for permanent gastrostomy using a Foley catheter within a gastric tunnel.,1\r\n14600,OSTOMÍAS RADIOLOGICAS,\"Ostomías radiológicas refer to procedures like gastrostomía radiológica percutánea, which do not require anesthesia or endoscopy.\",1\r\n14604,TUBO DE ALIMENTACIÓN,,1\r\n14592,ANESTESIA LOCAL,\"Anestesia local is a type of anesthesia utilized in various medical procedures, including faringostomía and gastrostomía endoscópica. Its primary purpose is to minimize pain in the specific area being treated, allowing for the procedure to be performed with reduced risk of complications compared to general anesthesia. This localized approach enhances patient safety and comfort during interventions.\",1\r\n14588,TÉCNICA DE PONSKY-GAUDERER,\"La técnica de Ponsky-Gauderer es un método específico para realizar una gastrostomía endoscópica, que implica el uso de un endoscopio y anestesia tópica para facilitar la inserción de la sonda.\",1\r\n14589,TÉCNICA DE SACKS-VINE,\"La técnica de Sacks-Vine es un método de colocación de sonda de gastrostomía que se realiza bajo visión endoscópica, utilizando una aguja introductora para guiar el catéter al estómago.\",1\r\n14590,TÉCNICA DE RUSSELL,\"La técnica de Russell es un procedimiento percutáneo para la colocación de una sonda de gastrostomía, que utiliza un balón tipo Foley y control endoscópico para asegurar la correcta colocación de la sonda.\",1\r\n14591,YEYUNOSTOMÍA ENDOSCÓPICA,\"La yeyunostomía endoscópica es un procedimiento que permite la inserción de una sonda en el yeyuno, indicado para pacientes con riesgo de aspiración, manteniendo la motilidad y función absortiva del intestino.\",1\r\n14603,CATÉTER FINO,\"Catéter fino is a thin tube used in medical procedures, particularly in yeyunostomía, to facilitate feeding directly into the jejunum.\",1\r\n14602,COMPLICACIONES DE LAS SONDAS DE YEYUNOSTOMÍA,\"Complicaciones de las sondas de yeyunostomía refer to potential issues that can arise from the use of feeding tubes in the jejunum, including obstruction and infection.\",1\r\n14598,TÉCNICA DE WITZEL,Técnica de Witzel involves creating a seromuscular tunnel around the catheter to reduce leakage risk during yeyunostomía.,1\r\n2502,NEDC TRANSPILÓRICA,NEDC transpiloric refers to a method of nutrient delivery that may require the use of infusion pumps in specific patient populations.,1\r\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,combined_degree\r\n3310,PACIENTE,GASTROSTOMÍA,\"The patient is a recipient of a gastrostomy, a medical procedure performed to provide nutritional support when oral feeding is not feasible. This intervention was specifically undertaken to facilitate nutritional intake, addressing the patient's inability to eat normally. In this case, the gastrostomy is utilized for nocturnal feeding, highlighting the patient's specific nutritional needs and the importance of this procedure in ensuring adequate nourishment.\",581\r\n3481,PACIENTE,YEYUNOSTOMÍA,Patients may require jejunostomy for enteral feeding if the stomach is not functional,561\r\n3316,PACIENTE,RADIOLOGÍA INTERVENCIONISTA,The interventional radiology department attempted to assist in the placement of a gastrostomy for the patient,549\r\n2677,NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL,GASTROSTOMÍA,\"NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL and GASTROSTOMÍA are closely related concepts in the context of providing nutritional support to patients. Gastrostomy is a medical procedure that facilitates enteral nutrition for individuals who require long-term nutritional assistance. This procedure is particularly important for patients who cannot tolerate oral diets or when oral feeding is not feasible. In such cases, gastrostomy serves as a viable option to ensure that patients receive the necessary nutrients directly into the stomach, thereby supporting their overall health and well-being.\",370\r\n2747,NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL,GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA,GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA is a method for providing NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL,344\r\n2870,NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL,SONDAS,\"NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL refers to the process of delivering nutrition directly to the gastrointestinal tract, typically when oral intake is not possible. SONDAS, or feeding tubes, are essential tools in this process, as they are specifically designed to administer enteral nutrition to patients who cannot consume food orally. These devices facilitate the delivery of necessary nutrients, ensuring that individuals receive adequate nutrition despite their inability to eat by mouth.\",340\r\n494,PACIENTES,GASTROSTOMÍA,\"Gastrostomía is a medical procedure performed on pacientes who require nutritional support due to various medical conditions. This method is commonly utilized to provide nutrition to pacientes who have difficulties swallowing, ensuring they receive the necessary sustenance for their health and well-being.\",262\r\n800,NUTRICIÓN,GASTROSTOMÍA,La gastrostomía se utiliza para proporcionar nutrición enteral a pacientes que no pueden alimentarse por vía oral,244\r\n632,PACIENTES,YEYUNOSTOMÍA,Yeyunostomía is performed on pacientes when gastrostomy is not feasible.,242\r\n623,PACIENTES,LAPAROTOMÍA,Patients who have undergone laparotomy may need enteral nutrition to support recovery,230\r\n633,PACIENTES,FARINGOSTOMÍA,Faringostomía is indicated for pacientes with specific conditions like trauma or malformations.,229\r\n5579,GASTROSTOMÍA,NUTRICIÓN PEDIÁTRICA,GASTROSTOMÍA is a procedure relevant to pediatric nutrition for patients needing long-term feeding,197\r\n7741,YEYUNOSTOMÍA,NUTRICIÓN PEDIÁTRICA,YEYUNOSTOMÍA is a procedure relevant to pediatric nutrition for patients needing long-term feeding,177\r\n2363,PATIENT,GASTROSTOMÍA,The patient had a gastrostomy placed to assist with feeding due to his low weight,159\r\n5559,GASTROSTOMÍA,DIETOTERAPIA,Gastrostomy is a method used in dietotherapy for patients requiring nutritional support,129\r\n5572,GASTROSTOMÍA,NUTRICIÓN ARTIFICIAL,Gastrostomy is a method used to provide artificial nutrition to patients who cannot eat orally,128\r\n5565,GASTROSTOMÍA,FIBROSIS QUÍSTICA,Gastrostomy is often employed for long-term nutritional support i